                    <strong>Chartered Accountancy (CA)</strong> is one of the most respected
                    professional qualifications in India, awarded by the
                    <strong>Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI)</strong>.
                    Recognised nationally and internationally, the CA qualification
                    prepares students to become experts in finance, accounting,
                    auditing, taxation, and corporate compliance.
                </p>

                <p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
                    Chartered Accountants play an essential role in helping
                    organisations manage finances, conduct audits, optimise taxation,
                    ensure legal compliance, and make strategic business decisions.
