                    on skilled CAs.
                </p>

                <p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
                    The CA programme consists of three structured levels —
                    <strong style="color:#7A1010;">CA Foundation</strong>,
                    <strong style="color:#7A1010;">CA Intermediate</strong>, and
                    <strong style="color:#7A1010;">CA Final</strong>.
                    Students also complete a mandatory
                    <strong>3-Year Articleship</strong>, gaining practical experience
                    under a practising Chartered Accountant while preparing for higher-level examinations.
                </p>

                <p class="text-secondary lh-lg">
                    ICAI conducts examinations twice every year, allowing students to
                    progress through each stage systematically.
                    Success requires conceptual clarity, disciplined preparation,
